<h5><span style="color: #ed1c2b;">Mandated Community Service</span></h5>
<p class="PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer" data-start="32" data-end="370">If you need to complete mandated community service requirements, please submit the form below. Our volunteer coordinator will contact you to discuss available shifts and assignments.<span class="PDq2pG_selectionAnchor" aria-hidden="true"></span></p>
<p data-start="372" data-end="389"><strong data-start="372" data-end="388">Please note:</strong></p>
<ul data-start="390" data-end="778">
<li data-section-id="1eogiv2" data-start="390" data-end="471">There is no need to register an account.</li>
<li data-section-id="1nzf2fy" data-start="472" data-end="584">Availability is limited, spots are first-come, first-serve.</li>
<li data-section-id="guodl3" data-start="585" data-end="646">Community Service Workers must be 18 or older.</li>
<li data-section-id="1gqnb6r" data-start="647" data-end="778">If you need help with the online form or have questions, contact our Volunteer Coordinator at (706) 922-8382.</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="780" data-end="840"><strong data-start="780" data-end="815">Submit the Form Below to Apply:</strong></p>
<p class="cta-button-group d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 my-3 justify-content-center" style="text-align: center;"><a class="btn btn-secondary gap-1 mt-2" href="https://forms.cloud.microsoft/r/XV2qBpAvFm?origin=lprLink" title="Mandated Community Service">Fill Out Form</a></p>
